Hello! It's me, Myu.

Well, I decided to earn some extra money during carnival.
I am selling the tastiest açaí on the continent.
But did you hear what happened? A monstrous fish appeared out of nowhere, and everyone ran.
In the middle of the mess, I lost the ingredients for my Big Açaí Bowl: the açaí, the cupuaçu, the confetti, the peanut candy, the banana, the strawberry and the granola.
Those creatures took all my ingredients.

Can you help me get the ingredients back?

Bring me the açaí, the cupuaçu, the confetti, the peanut candy, the banana, the strawberry and the granola, and I will give you a Big Açaí Bowl.
